{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"無綫員工飯堂疑聘洗碗黑工　一名越南籍女子被捕\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/TVB-LABOUR-261021-20.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】據了解無綫集團員工飯堂涉聘請非法勞工，一名越南籍女子被捕。</p><p>勞工處於無綫位於將軍澳的電視廣播城員工飯堂例行巡查期間，要求一名越南籍洗碗女子出示身份證，職員發現證件有可疑，於是報警。警方查核後發現身份證失效，於是將該名女子拘捕。</p><p>據了解飯堂屬外判商，女子於2020年受聘，月薪兩萬元。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T16:02:35.950487+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T12:16:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T17:17:54.247294+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:58:11.350475+00:00","content_hash":"12226ac0ac69fdf819569a9e2151f4a9a2ac31680112a64c3c8f41cb86668c7d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-22T16:02:35.950487+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}